   "title": "991v2 Made in UK",
   "handle": "728334",
   "body_html": "Part of the 'Elevated Essentials' pack, the New Balance Made in UK 991v2 arrives in a full black outfit. A mesh upper is overlaid with velvety suede panelling and leather accents. FuelCell cushioning and ABZORB SBS pods ensure signature New Balance comfort from the black midsole. To finish, the 'Made in England' hallmark confirms quality on the tongue. | U991KK2",
