   "title": "GEL-KAYANO 12.1 Women's",
   "handle": "764992",
   "body_html": "Borrowing the upper from the GEL-KAYANO 12, ASICS release the GEL-KAYANO 12.1 with a wide mesh base layered with futuristic silver metallic caging and accentuated by hits of green. Creating a true hybrid design, ASICS repurpose the GEL-NIMBUS 17 sole unit with FluidRide technology and GEL inserts for plush cushioning. Final touches come from subtle branding around the heels and the Kanji logo on the tongue. | 1203A759.100",
